<title>MOZAMBIQUE: PRESS DIGEST - Mozambique - July 1.</title>
<headline>PRESS DIGEST - Mozambique - July 1.</headline>
<dateline>MAPUTO 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>These are the leading stories in the Mozambican press on Tuesday. Reuters has not verified these stories and does not vouch for their accuracy.</p>
<p>- - - -</p>
<p>NOTICIAS</p>
<p>- Parliament elected seven members to the National Electoral Commission on Monday. Four are from the ruling Frelimo party and three from the oppostion Renamo.</p>
<p>- The Health Ministry it planned to expand the country's health network by a further 15 percent by the end of the century.</p>
<p>- - - -</p>
